IMPORT policy

-- Standing preamble (applies to every question below): assume all other
-- conditions are met and no other exclusions apply, i.e. every field not
-- mentioned by the question is set to a value that keeps coverage clean.
-- Also assumed throughout: the agreement has been signed and the premium
-- was paid on time.

-- Q1: hospitalized by burns suffered while doing my duty as a firefighter.
q1 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 2
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 45
    `causes`                                     IS LIST Firefighting
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 1
    `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS TRUE
    `written confirmation month`                 IS JUST 2
    `dispute arisen`                             IS FALSE
    `unable to settle month`                     IS NOTHING
    `arbitration commenced month`                IS NOTHING
    `valid arbitration award issued`             IS TRUE
    `written proof of claim month`               IS JUST 0
    `recovery sought month`                      IS JUST 3
    `policy term months`                         IS 12
    `confined in us hospital`                    IS TRUE
    `continuous confinement days`                IS JUST 3
    `claim made setting out basis`               IS TRUE

#EVAL covered q1

