-- Q9: hospitalized due to my son biting me in the ankle; proof of wellness
-- visit provided 6 months after the effective date; I was serving as a
-- police officer at the time of hospitalization.
-- Judgement call (see NOTES.md): "serving as a police officer at the time"
-- describes contemporaneous employment, not the cause of the injury -- a
-- son's bite does not arise "directly or indirectly out of" police service,
-- so `causes` does NOT include `Police service`.
q9 MEANS Claim WITH
    `agreement signed`                           IS TRUE
    `premium paid month`                         IS JUST 0
    `hospitalization month`                      IS 6
    `hospitalization ground`                     IS `Accidental injury`
    `age at hospitalization`                     IS 35
    `causes`                                     IS EMPTY
    `fraud month`                                IS NOTHING
    `misrepresentation month`                    IS NOTHING
    `wellness visit month`                       IS JUST 1
